# Crib Swap: its target is checked again as it resolves (CR 608.2b) and an object that leaves and returns is a new object
# (CR 400.7). Bot1 aims it at Bot2's Elvish Mystic; in response Bot2 pays {W} (Mox Pearl) for Ephemerate on it. The spell does not
# resolve (ruling), so no Shapeshifter is made and the Mystic stays.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Crib Swap
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Mox Pearl
Elvish Mystic
Ephemerate
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Elvish Mystic.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Crib Swap.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Elvish Mystic)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Ephemerate.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Elvish Mystic)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield = Forest; Mox Pearl; Elvish Mystic
Bot1.Graveyard = Crib Swap
